        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Silent World, Zeitgeist film series\n- People: Jacques-Yves Cousteau, Louis Malle\n- Events: 1956 Cannes Film Festival\n- Concepts: Documentary films, conspiracy theories\n\nFacts:\n- In 1956, The Silent World was released as a French documentary film.\n- In 1956, Jacques-Yves Cousteau and Louis Malle co-directed The Silent World.\n- In 1956, the 1956 Cannes Film Festival awarded the Palme d'Or to The Silent World by Jacques-Yves Cousteau and Louis Malle.\n- Between 2007 and 2011, the Zeitgeist film series released three documentary films.\n- The Zeitgeist film series presents a number of conspiracy theories and proposals for broad social and economic changes.",
